      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mullery O'Gara are delighted to present No. 20 Thorncliffe to the market, an exceptionally well-presented two-bedroom, dual-aspect own-door duplex apartment within this exclusive gated development just off Dundrum Road.\r\n\r\nThis fine home will appeal to first-time buyers and investors alike with bright, spacious accommodation extending to approximately 101 sq.m. / 1087 sq.ft. The property is within walking distance of both Dundrum and Milltown villages.\r\n\r\nA welcoming entrance hall with wood laminate flooring runs throughout the ground floor. To the front is a contemporary kitchen fitted with an extensive range of modern white shaker-style units, complemented by an integrated Neff oven and microwave, hob and dishwasher, along with excellent fitted storage. A large west-facing window brings in plenty of natural light and a modern electric radiator completes the room. \r\n\r\nOff the hallway is a stylish guest W.C. with wash hand basin, followed by a generous utility room fitted with bespoke floor-to-ceiling cabinetry, a fitted hanging rail and it is plumbed for a washing machine and drier. \r\n\r\nThe accommodation then opens into a superb east-facing living/dining room overlooking the communal gardens through a large picture window. A fitted solid fuel stove serves as an attractive focal point and there is a useful understairs storage area for items such as golf clubs, vacuum cleaners and luggage.\r\n\r\nUpstairs is fully carpeted. The spacious master bedroom has an excellent range of built-in wardrobes and fitted presses, along with a fully tiled en-suite comprising a walk-in shower, wash hand basin with vanity unit, W.C., heated towel rail and mirrored storage cabinet. \r\nThe second double bedroom also has built-in wardrobes and additional fitted storage beneath the eaves with good natural light from a large Velux window.\r\n\r\nThe main bathroom is fully tiled and fitted with a bath with overhead shower attachment, wash hand basin with vanity unit, W.C. heated towel rail and mirrored storage cabinet. A hot press is on the landing completes the accommodation\r\nOutside, the property has ample residents' off-street parking to the front and side. To the rear are well-maintained residents' communal lawned gardens.\r\n\r\nThe location is excellent. Thorncliffe is a highly regarded and much sought-after development within easy walking distance of Milltown Village, Dundrum Village and Dundrum Town Centre. The LUAS at Milltown, numerous Dublin Bus routes, the M50 and the city centre are all easily accessible. The area also benefits from an abundance of recreational amenities including the River Dodder greenway, Dartry Park, Herbert Park and nearby river walks, while David Lloyd Riverview, UCD Belfield and a good selection of primary and secondary schools are all within reach."
      },
